cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fuzzfw in research or a product, cite this repository and record the exact version/tag."
title: "fuzzfw: deterministic source-level selective host-lifting for embedded C/C++ fuzzing"
abstract: "A local and CI-oriented tool that analyzes embedded C/C++ build metadata, preserves original translation units, replaces only approved hardware boundaries, verifies target reachability and input use, and reproduces findings for CI."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/fuzzfw/fuzzfw"
authors:
  - name: "fuzzfw contributors"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
keywords:
  - fuzzing
  - embedded
  - firmware
  - clang
  - llvm
  - host-lifting
